**Flaw:** Missing authorization — grant existence-only check (no permissionKey or label-scope validation).

**Escalation:** Any same-company grant (e.g. read-only or unrelated labels) lets the gate-keeper write the issue, bypassing label-scoped `tasks:gate_keeper_write` and enabling cross-label issue mutation.

**Fix:**
```js
function canGateKeeperWrite(actor, issue, grant) {
  if (actor.companyId !== issue.companyId) return false;
  if (!grant || grant.permissionKey !== 'tasks:gate_keeper_write') return false;
  const issueLabels = new Set(issue.labels ?? []);
  return (grant.labels ?? []).some(l => issueLabels.has(l));
}
```

